# Retired addresses, each sent permanently to the page that replaced it.
#
# The website compositions had a section of their own at /patterns/ until they
# became the Website group of the component catalogue. Links to the old section
# are out in the world, so every one of them keeps working.
#
# Both spellings of each path, because Pages matches a trailing slash literally.
# The static index rules come first: the first matching rule wins, and a
# placeholder never matches an empty segment anyway.
#
# `src/content/__tests__/redirects.test.ts` holds every retired address to a
# page the export still publishes, and `scripts/serve-out.mjs` serves these
# rules to the end-to-end suite through the same reader.
/patterns/ /components/#website 301
/patterns /components/#website 301
/zh/patterns/ /zh/components/#website 301
/zh/patterns /zh/components/#website 301
/patterns/:slug/ /components/:slug/ 301
/patterns/:slug /components/:slug/ 301
/zh/patterns/:slug/ /zh/components/:slug/ 301
/zh/patterns/:slug /zh/components/:slug/ 301
